Harmony 1.2.0 Android 16 preview

- Targets Android 16 (API 36)
- Playback uses Media3 ExoPlayer
- Visualizers no longer need the microphone
- YouTube extract, ads, and Firebase removed
- Library is rebuilt from MediaStore on each launch (not persisted yet)

Sideload this debug APK, grant Music and audio, then play a local file.
